Changes to the contract that no artifact shows, one line each, oldest first.

Some changes reach extensions without changing a CRD, the HTTP API or the
Go API of the contract packages: code that imposes a new requirement on
extensions, or gives a field they already write a new meaning. Record such
a change on a line of its own below, naming its pull request, then run
make gen-contract: every line of this file is part of the contract's
fingerprint, so the contract version moves as it does for any other
contract change. See README.md.
